{"id": 68, "ts": 1780431818.2497182, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 4, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I\u2019m still inclined to recommend Candidate\u202fC.\u202fEmily highlighted his 100\u202f% reliability and the fact that he creates a positive atmosphere with his crew\u2014both are essential for the long\u2011haul environment where consistent performance and teamwork are non\u2011negotiable. While C does have communication difficulties, is seen as egocentric, and is not very eager to pursue further education, these are development areas that can be addressed through targeted training and mentorship. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB, although strong on stress handling and conscientiousness, has been noted as grumpy and uncooperative, which raises red flags for crew cooperation on extended flights. Given that reliability and crew cohesion outweigh the manageable communication concerns, I maintain my vote for Candidate\u202fC."}
